      "actor_id": "parent-mediated-review",
      "summary": "Provenance verified (single-parent commit 2705756 on base 21cbcf4, tree 9907705). The round-3 delta makes laneOrigin skip integrated or released Lanes of a hidden-ref batch, so their delivered bytes are no longer treated as a leak and restored. It is consistent with the source, the dist bundle wiring and a control-plus-negative test. Hidden-ref advance, scoped delta apply and conflict parking, and the preflight no-commit and scope-only blocking behavior meet S2-AC1 and S2-AC2.",
      "acceptance_results": [],
